# All text files check out with LF everywhere. This matters for byte-level
# verification: the frozen judging module src/judge/drct_common.py must keep
# its registered md5 (7c31b58da9d7228cee31b9be581fe5dd) after checkout on
# any platform, and MANIFEST_SHA256.txt hashes LF bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.npz binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
